      "message": "Can\u0027t you get the same information using existing tracepoints? You can use ftrace to get timestamps on the trace events. You can consider `trace_binder_transaction()` or `trace_android_vh_binder_transaction_init()` as the beginning of a transaction and `trace_android_vh_binder_reply()` to detect a reply transaction. Your vendor module can attach to any of these to do the book-keeping if you prefer.\n\nIf you really need to include this with the binder state dump, you can add a vendor hook in `print_binder_transaction_ilocked()` to add it to the end of the transaction output.",
